MMO_Tool_Hatchet_Millwright.name = Millwright's Hatchet
MMO_Tool_Hatchet_Millwright.description = An onyxium hatchet, worn smooth by a lifetime of boards. The mill pays it out to whoever keeps the saw fed long enough.
MMO_Tool_Hatchet_Marn.name = Marn's Hatchet
MMO_Tool_Hatchet_Marn.description = Cobalt on a straight haft, tempered in life essence and fitted by Sawyer Marn for one pair of hands. It cuts the way his does.
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Head.name = Woodcutter's Cap
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Head.description = A soft leather cap that keeps the sawdust out of a sawyer's eyes. Sawyer Marn pays it out of a good day's trim.
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Chest.name = Woodcutter's Jerkin
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Chest.description = A soft leather jerkin, sleeves cut short for the reach across a log. The piece Sawyer Marn parts with least.
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Hands.name = Woodcutter's Gloves
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Hands.description = Soft leather gloves, worn thin where the haft sits. Paid out of the trim, a good day at a time.
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Legs.name = Woodcutter's Breeches
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Legs.description = Soft leather breeches, patched at the knee from kneeling to the log. Sawyer Marn parts with them when the cut is clean.
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Novice_Head.name = Woodcutter's Novice Cap
MMO_Armor_Woodcutter_Novice_Head.description = A plain wooden cap, Sawyer Marn's gift to a new sawyer. The proper kit is leather, and comes a piece at a time.
